@host = http://localhost:5000
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### Liveness / readiness
GET {{host}}/health
###
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### List inspections
GET {{api}}/inspections?page=1&pageSize=20

### Create inspection: nadir photo, scale from the visible width (multipart)
POST {{api}}/inspections
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=pavelens

--pavelens
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Av. El Sol — prueba manual
--pavelens
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notes"

Bache con agua empozada.
--pavelens
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="referenceWidthM"

3.0
--pavelens
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="roadSegmentId"

V13
--pavelens
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="av-el-sol-bache.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../samples/av-el-sol-bache.jpg
--pavelens--

### Create inspection: oblique photo with a 4-point calibration
POST {{api}}/inspections
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=pavelens

--pavelens
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Jr. Lima — tramo calibrado
--pavelens
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="calibration"

{"corners":[[0.08,0.95],[0.92,0.95],[0.60,0.42],[0.40,0.42]],"widthM":7,"lengthM":25}
--pavelens
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="jr-lima-tramo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../samples/jr-lima-tramo.jpg
--pavelens--

### Detail (replace the ids)
@id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@distressId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{api}}/inspections/{{id}}

### Budget (APU)
GET {{api}}/inspections/{{id}}/budget

### Field-measured depth of a pothole
PUT {{api}}/inspections/{{id}}/distresses/{{distressId}}/depth
Content-Type: application/json

{ "depthM": 0.06 }

### Ask the assistant
POST {{api}}/inspections/{{id}}/conversation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "¿Cuánta mezcla en caliente necesito para todo el tramo?" }

### Road network (synthetic demo)
GET {{api}}/network

### Work zone: close one lane of Jr. Lima (H11)
POST {{api}}/traffic/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "segmentId": "H11", "lanesClosed": 1 }
